{"id":"vision\/annotation\/entity","type":"","title":"Google\\Cloud\\Vision\\Annotation\\Entity","name":"Entity","description":"<p>Represents an entity annotation. Entities are created by several\n<a href=\"https:\/\/cloud.google.com\/vision\/docs\/\">Google Cloud Vision<\/a> features, namely\n<code>LANDMARK_DETECTION<\/code>, <code>LOGO_DETECTION<\/code>, <code>LABEL_DETECTION<\/code> and <code>TEXT_DETECTION<\/code>.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[{"title":{},"link":{}}],"methods":[{"id":"__construct","type":"constructor","name":"__construct","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php#L196","description":"<p>Create an entity annotation result.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"info","description":"<p>The entity annotation result<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[]},{"id":"mid","type":"instance","name":"mid","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"<p>Some IDs might be available in Knowledge Graph(KG).<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[{"title":{},"link":{}}],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"locale","type":"instance","name":"locale","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"description","type":"instance","name":"description","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"score","type":"instance","name":"score","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"<p>Range [0, 1].<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.float.php\" target=\"_blank\">float<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"confidence","type":"instance","name":"confidence","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"<p>For example, for an image containing 'Eiffel Tower,' this field\nrepresents the confidence that there is a tower in the query image.<\/p>\n<p>Range [0, 1].<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.float.php\" target=\"_blank\">float<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"topicality","type":"instance","name":"topicality","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"<p>For example, the relevancy of 'tower' to an image containing\n'Eiffel Tower' is likely higher than an image containing a distant\ntowering building, though the confidence that there is a tower may be the\nsame.<\/p>\n<p>Range [0, 1].<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.float.php\" target=\"_blank\">float<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"boundingPoly","type":"instance","name":"boundingPoly","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"<p>Not filled currently for LABEL_DETECTION features. For TEXT_DETECTION\n(OCR), boundingPolys are produced for the entire text detected in an\nimage region, followed by boundingPolys for each word within the detected\ntext.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"locations","type":"instance","name":"locations","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"<p>Multiple LocationInfo elements can be present since one location may\nindicate the location of the scene in the query image, and another the\nlocation of the place where the query image was taken. Location\ninformation is usually present for landmarks.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"properties","type":"instance","name":"properties","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"info","type":"instance","name":"info","source":"Vision\/src\/Annotation\/Entity.php","description":"","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"description":""}]}]}